# core.autocrlf is true here, so every checked-out text file gets CRLF endings.
# Git's own heuristic correctly leaves the committed launcher executables alone,
# but that is a heuristic and these binaries are checked out onto other people's
# machines -- a single byte rewritten by line-ending conversion produces an .exe
# that will not start. Pin them as binary rather than relying on detection.
*.exe -text
